</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive the variance reduction obtained by blocking under a suitable
additive model.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Study optimal allocation between two treatment groups when costs or
variances differ.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive factorial effect estimates for a <m>2^k</m> design using contrast
